Dialogue: 5,0:00:15.67,0:00:17.77,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Гайхалтай дуусгалаа!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:17.77,0:00:22.17,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Шөвгийн 8-ийн эхний ялагч, Осака Сэйсэйша!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:22.17,0:00:23.41,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Кавасаки!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:23.41,0:00:25.29,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Энэ эрчээрээ аварга хүртэл шүү!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.29,0:00:26.18,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Сайхан тоглолоо!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:26.18,0:00:27.00,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Ойрхон байлаа!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:27.00,0:00:28.58,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Зун эргээд ирээрэй!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:28.58,0:00:30.18,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Сайн тоглосон шүү!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:32.42,0:00:38.51,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Яамамори, Яакүши ахлах сургууль нарын тоглолт 11 цагт эхэлнэ.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:39.19,0:00:42.05,Default,@Maezono,0,0,0,,Кавасаки-гийн цохилтоор шийдэгдэв үү?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:42.05,0:00:43.58,Default,@Shirasu,0,0,0,,Эргүүлэгтэй шидчих шив? 
Dialogue: 5,0:00:43.58,0:00:46.20,Default,@Kuramochi,0,0,0,,Камижо-гийн Сасаки-д хэцүү байгаа байх даа.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:46.20,0:00:47.82,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,Өнөөдөр хүйтэн байна уу? 
Dialogue: 5,0:00:47.82,0:00:49.70,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,Дулаарахгүй байна шүү.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:49.70,0:00:51.54,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,Мөс хэрэггүй юм биш үү?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:52.51,0:00:54.06,Default,@Tojo,0,0,0,,Өнөөдөр хэд шидсэн бэ?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:54.06,0:00:56.21,Default,@Kanemaru,0,0,0,,Маргааш шидэхгүй байлгүй.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:56.70,0:01:00.21,Default,@Kanemaru,0,0,0,,Кавасаки-сан, аймаар царайтай ч гэсэн, удирдлага сайтай юм аа? 
Dialogue: 5,0:01:01.23,0:01:02.41,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Манайхаан!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:03.21,0:01:04.84,Default,Sachiko,0,0,0,,Автобус ирчихлээ!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:04.84,0:01:05.84,Default,_All,0,0,0,,Тийм ээ!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:08.35,0:01:09.30,Default,@Miyuki,0,0,0,,Алив, явцгаая!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:10.04,0:01:11.56,Default,_All,0,0,0,,Тийм ээ!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:18.93,0:01:20.65,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Аварга хүртэл хоёр тоглолт!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:21.52,0:01:23.15,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Одоо л эхэлж байна шүү!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:23.15,0:01:24.90,Default,_All,0,0,0,,Тийм ээ!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:31.91,0:01:31.91,Default,chapter,0,0,0,,{OP}
Dialogue: 5,0:03:02.70,0:03:04.13,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Юу? Тасалбар байхгүй юм уу?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:04.13,0:03:04.96,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Хүйтэн байна!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:04.96,0:03:06.73,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Өчигдөр унтаж чадсангүй.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:06.73,0:03:07.71,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Би ч гэсэн!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:07.71,0:03:09.72,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Гайхалтай хүмүүс тоглохоор байсан!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:10.27,0:03:12.78,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Хүсэн хүлээсэн 4 дэх тоглолт.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:12.78,0:03:17.25,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Баруун Токиогийн Сэйдо-гийн эсрэг өмнөд Хоккайдон Комадай Фүжимаки.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:17.25,0:03:18.47,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Тоглолт удахгүй эхэлнэ!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:18.47,0:03:20.73,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Тэр Яакүши-гийн Тодороки Мишима хоёр биш үү?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:22.11,0:03:24.48,Default,Mishima,0,0,0,,Чимээгүй бай, баригдчихдаг юм байгаа биз дээ? 
Dialogue: 5,0:03:24.98,0:03:27.41,Default,Owada,0,0,0,,Гайхалтай юм аа, бүх суудал дүүрэн байна.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:27.41,0:03:28.23,Default,Mine,0,0,0,,Тийм ээ.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:28.23,0:03:31.87,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,150км шидэгчдийн өрсөлдөөнийг хармаар байна!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:31.87,0:03:34.11,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Хоёулаа олигтой ярилцлага өгөөгүй байсан.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:34.11,0:03:35.75,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Бороо орохгүй байгаасай.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.75,0:03:37.49,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Сэйдо эхлээд цохино.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:37.49,0:03:40.25,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Өнөөдрийн гараанд Фүрүяа байгаа юм уу? 
Dialogue: 5,0:03:42.70,0:03:45.83,Default,Ota,0,0,0,,Шууд энэ хүнээр цохиулна гэхээр...
Dialogue: 5,0:03:45.83,0:03:48.55,Default,Ochiai,0,0,0,,Яахав, болохгүй ч биш л дээ.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:48.55,0:03:50.80,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Комадай Фүжимаки эхэлж цохих нь.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:51.40,0:03:53.32,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Тэмцээн эхэлснээс хойш анх удаагаа,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:53.32,0:03:56.92,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}2-р ангийн Эйс Хонго Масамүнэ, шидэж эхэлж байна.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:57.98,0:04:01.06,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Баригчаар, адил 2-р анги, Энжо Рэнжи.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:01.83,0:04:04.54,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Эхний хагасаас Эйсүүдийн тулааныг харах гэж...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:04.54,0:04:06.81,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Нитта дасгалжуулагч ч уур амьсгалаа мэдэрч байна шүү.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:06.81,0:04:08.82,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Тэгнэ гэж байхгүй шүү дээ!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:11.18,0:04:13.45,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,Эцэст нь шөвгийн 8.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:17.13,0:04:20.83,Default,Seto,0,0,0,,Нитта дасгалжуулагч гараагаа байнга нэг хэвийн байлгадаг байх аа? 
Dialogue: 5,0:04:20.83,0:04:23.92,Default,Seto,0,0,0,,Солилцоо хийсэнд нь учир байгаа л байх.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:24.66,0:04:27.89,Default,Okumura,0,0,0,,Анхнаасаа энэ тоглолтод бэлдсэн байж ч магадгүй.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:27.89,0:04:29.60,Default,Seto,0,0,0,,Шөвгийн 8 уу? 
Dialogue: 5,0:04:32.41,0:04:37.51,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Комадай Фүжимаки, Нитта дасгалжуулагч болон\NСэйдо ахлах сургуулийн Катаока.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:37.51,0:04:40.17,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Хоёул шидэлтийн чадвартаа найдаж ирсэн багууд.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.85,0:04:44.63,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Энэ тэмцээн ч бас шидэгчийн сэлгэлтээр шийдэгдэж болох юм.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:45.85,0:04:48.22,Default,@Tojo,0,0,0,,Гурав дахь нь байнга бэлэн байдаг шүү.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:48.22,0:04:48.86,Default,@Kuramochi,0,0,0,,Тийм ээ.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.43,0:04:55.99,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Сэйдо Ахлах сургуулийн эхний цохигчоор, Шорт, Күрамочи.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:58.56,0:05:02.45,Default,@int_Kuramochi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Хүлээлгэж байснаас шууд тулгарсан нь хамаагүй дээр юм байна.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:02.95,0:05:04.59,Default,@int_Kuramochi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Аль нь ч байсан,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:06.15,0:05:08.71,Default,@int_Kuramochi,0,0,0,,{\i1}энэ шидэгчийг давахгүй л бол...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:09.49,0:05:11.21,Default,@int_Kuramochi,0,0,0,,{\i1}ялах боломж байхгүй!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:13.24,0:05:14.23,Default,_Umpire,0,0,0,,Эхэл!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:17.79,0:05:19.72,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Хүсэн хүлээсэн шидэлт!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:20.01,0:05:23.97,Default,@int_Kuramochi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, I did tease drag bunts in the first and second rounds.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:25.42,0:05:28.06,Default,@int_Kuramochi,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I'm swinging at the first pitch here!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:31.17,0:05:32.74,Default,_Umpire,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:35.40,0:05:38.07,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Whoa! His first pitch is 150 km/h!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:38.07,0:05:39.95,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Going all-out already?!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:39.95,0:05:42.06,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,And he put it on the inside corner!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:42.06,0:05:44.03,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Hongou is incredible!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:45.28,0:05:46.46,Default,@Kuramochi,0,0,0,,Well, damn.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:48.75,0:05:50.92,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,No, he's swinging just fine!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:57.84,0:05:59.47,Default,_Umpire,0,0,0,,Strike two!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:59.47,0:06:00.70,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Outside corner!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:00.70,0:06:03.12,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,After that inside pitch, no way he could swing at that!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:03.12,0:06:05.47,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Incredible! He won't hit anything!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:06.01,0:06:10.01,Default,_Reporter,0,0,0,,The way he pitches inside and outside so naturally is part of his strength.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:10.01,0:06:13.48,Default,_Reporter,0,0,0,,He looks wild, but he has excellent control.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:14.33,0:06:15.76,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now the third pitch!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:15.76,0:06:16.74,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Will it be a slider?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:16.74,0:06:17.82,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Or something else?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:18.45,0:06:19.49,Default,@int_Kuramochi,0,0,0,,{\i1}A splitter.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.38,0:06:24.24,Default,@fb_Kataoka,0,0,0,,Keep your strike zone high in this game.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:24.74,0:06:25.49,Default,@fb_Kataoka,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:25.89,0:06:26.87,Default,@fb_Kuramochi,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,224)}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:27.76,0:06:31.00,Default,@fb_Kataoka,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let the low balls go, even if you're down in the count.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:34.71,0:06:36.21,Default,@int_Kuramochi,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a fastball!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:45.41,0:06:47.02,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}He goes down swinging!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:47.49,0:06:51.52,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}The ace Hongou takes down their\N lead-off batter Kuramochi with a splitter!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:51.52,0:06:52.90,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,He swung at a pitch that bounced?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:52.90,0:06:55.02,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Shows how good his fastballs are!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:55.02,0:06:56.93,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Don, don, don't!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:56.93,0:06:58.03,Default,@Kuramochi,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:59.29,0:07:03.36,Default,@int_Kuramochi,0,0,0,,{\i1}They drop so steeply at that speed?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.57,Default,Todoroki,0,0,0,,I wanna hit that!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:06.57,0:07:09.54,Default,Mishima,0,0,0,,I wouldn't swing at an obvious ball like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:10.07,0:07:13.04,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Batting second, center fielder, Toujou.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:14.02,0:07:15.71,Default,@int_Tojo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wow.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:15.71,0:07:17.40,Default,@int_Tojo,0,0,0,,{\i1}And we're in the same year.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:29.18,0:07:30.67,Default,_Umpire,0,0,0,,Foul!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:30.67,0:07:32.44,Default,@int_Tojo,0,0,0,,{\i1}My swing's late.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:40.62,0:07:44.16,Default,@int_Tojo,0,0,0,,{\i1}It sank... at that speed?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:44.16,0:07:46.85,Default,_Umpire,0,0,0,,Strike three! You're out!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:46.85,0:07:48.55,Default,@int_Kominato,0,0,0,,{\i1}How does that pitch's arc look?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:48.55,0:07:51.93,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Batting third, second baseman, Kominato.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:54.94,0:08:00.42,Default,int_Nitta,0,0,0,,{\i1}Like he's taking out the stress of not \Ngetting to start until now on the batters,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:01.43,0:08:04.68,Default,int_Nitta,0,0,0,,{\i1}he lets his irritation, worries, frustration,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:05.94,0:08:09.15,Default,int_Nitta,0,0,0,,{\i1}and his anger at me explode.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:09.68,0:08:14.65,Default,int_Nitta,0,0,0,,{\i1}He can express all of his feelings through his pitching alone.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:15.09,0:08:17.72,Default,int_Nitta,0,0,0,,{\i1}His extraordinary ability allows him to do that.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:19.28,0:08:20.46,Default,@int_Kominato,0,0,0,,{\i1}The speed is...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:20.46,0:08:22.80,Default,@int_Kominato,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, the pressure is so intense.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:24.64,0:08:27.09,Default,@int_Kominato,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wanted to get a hit without getting to two strikes.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:31.16,0:08:32.16,Default,int_Nitta,0,0,0,,{\i1}He is truly...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:33.08,0:08:35.51,Default,int_Nitta,0,0,0,,{\i1}blessed by the baseball gods.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:43.40,0:08:44.95,Default,@int_Kominato,0,0,0,,{\i1}Three fastballs.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:45.73,0:08:47.64,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}And that's strike three!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:47.64,0:08:52.09,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}He takes down Seidou's top three batters in an incredible start!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:52.09,0:08:55.10,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}He has yet to allow a run at Koushien Stadium!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:56.26,0:09:00.23,Default,int_Nitta,0,0,0,,{\i1}No one knows the depths of his talent.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:01.00,0:09:05.96,Default,int_Nitta,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll gladly be the bad guy if it\N means helping Masamune grow.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:09.11,0:09:13.29,Default,@int_Sawamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's Komadai's... Hongou Masamune's pitching.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:13.59,0:09:17.02,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}So Kominato couldn't even make contact.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:17.02,0:09:20.81,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}We need to hit those fastballs if we hope to score.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:22.08,0:09:24.42,Default,@Kataoka,0,0,0,,Miyuki, get us some momentum.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:24.42,0:09:26.16,Default,@Kataoka,0,0,0,,Don't be passive.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:26.16,0:09:28.43,Default,Ochiai,0,0,0,,If you show weakness, they'll jump on it.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:28.43,0:09:29.19,Default,@Miyuki,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:30.31,0:09:32.90,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Okay, things are just getting started!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:32.90,0:09:34.18,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Let's stay tight on defense!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:34.18,0:09:35.18,Default,_All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:35.18,0:09:38.67,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Furuya, I think you know, but get the first batter out!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.67,0:09:39.94,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Take them one at a time!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:43.25,0:09:48.84,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Komadai Fujimaki's ace, Hongou, \Nhad an impressive start in the top of the first.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:48.84,0:09:51.78,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now in the bottom half of the inning,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:51.78,0:09:55.45,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}the pitcher who threw an incredible 154 km/h against Nihon Shouno,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:55.45,0:09:57.52,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Seidou's ace Furuya is on the mound.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:59.83,0:10:02.71,Default,Yui,0,0,0,,Now it's Furuya's turn.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:05.42,0:10:08.02,Default,Seto,0,0,0,,How fast will he pitch today?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:09.91,0:10:12.05,Default,@Furuya,0,0,0,,It's cold today.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:14.03,0:10:21.44,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Batting first in the bottom of the first for Komadai Fujimaki High School is the center fielder, Aku.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:21.82,0:10:24.19,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}After Hongou's impressive start,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:24.58,0:10:28.43,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}what kind of pitching will we see from Seidou's Furuya Satoru?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:29.54,0:10:32.11,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}This team likes to swing.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:32.11,0:10:33.95,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}They'll be looking for a meatball.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:36.29,0:10:39.21,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}A strong pitch to the outside.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:39.95,0:10:41.02,Default,@int_Furuya,0,0,0,,{\i1}Got it.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:44.61,0:10:48.71,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Two pitchers from Hokkaido are battling at Koushien Stadium!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:55.26,0:10:57.97,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}The first pitch is hit into shallow left field!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:25.00,0:11:28.51,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Komadai Fujimaki has a chance to extend their first-inning lead.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:28.51,0:11:31.76,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}How will Seidou's Furuya work through this situation?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:34.82,0:11:36.78,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}A strong hit between shortstop and third!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:42.38,0:11:43.59,Default,@Kominato,0,0,0,,Nice job, third!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:43.59,0:11:45.67,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Third baseman Kanemaru makes a great stop!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:45.67,0:11:47.07,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's three outs!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:49.76,0:11:54.95,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Komadai Fujimaki's eight-hole Etou is out, leaving a runner on base, and the score remains unchanged.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:55.27,0:12:01.93,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}After giving up two runs in the first, \NSeidou's ace Furuya Satoru has been showing real tenacity.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:03.67,0:12:05.96,Default,Ezaki,0,0,0,,After the lead-off batter's base hit,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:05.96,0:12:08.38,Default,Ezaki,0,0,0,,they moved the runner to second with a hit-and-run.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:08.38,0:12:11.59,Default,Ezaki,0,0,0,,The third batter walked, and the fourth struck out.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:11.59,0:12:14.47,Default,Ezaki,0,0,0,,The fifth batter, Enjou, \Ngot a two-RBI hit to right-center field.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:18.04,0:12:20.15,Default,Sugi,0,0,0,,They scored pretty quickly.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:20.15,0:12:24.18,Default,Ezaki,0,0,0,,Even the runner on first made it home because the return wasn't great.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:27.64,0:12:30.08,Default,Owada,0,0,0,,Furuya has settled into a rhythm.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:30.08,0:12:33.60,Default,Mine,0,0,0,,Yeah, and the fielders have his back.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:33.60,0:12:38.29,Default,Mine,0,0,0,,His pitches are still erratic, \Nbut that's just part of who he is as a player.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:38.29,0:12:40.37,Default,Mine,0,0,0,,Miyuki is calling a good game too.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:40.97,0:12:45.87,Default,Mine,0,0,0,,He gave up some runs, but he's doing his job as the ace.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:49.15,0:12:51.38,Default,Mine,0,0,0,,But two runs...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:53.01,0:12:56.12,Default,Mine,0,0,0,,Those will be hard to get back.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:57.26,0:13:00.14,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}In the top of the fifth, Seidou High School is up to bat.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:00.14,0:13:03.39,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Their only time on base was when Shirasu was walked.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:04.01,0:13:07.91,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Seidou High School has yet to get a hit off of Hongou!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:11.15,0:13:12.70,Default,@Miyuki,0,0,0,,Start with one!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:12.70,0:13:14.44,Default,@Miyuki,0,0,0,,Get on base and create opportunities for the team!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:15.13,0:13:16.20,Default,_All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:16.90,0:13:23.95,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Batting first in the top of the fifth for \NSeidou High School is the pitcher, Furuya.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:27.37,0:13:29.25,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Swing for the fences, Furuya!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:29.25,0:13:30.88,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,If you make contact, something will happen!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:31.84,0:13:35.88,Default,@int_Furuya,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll get back the runs I gave up.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:37.25,0:13:40.39,Default,int_Enjo,0,0,0,,{\i1}This guy can knock it out of the park, Masamune.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:47.55,0:13:49.60,Default,int_Enjo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right, he doesn't go easy on anyone.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:50.34,0:13:53.45,Default,int_Enjo,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's the most competitive guy I know.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:53.45,0:13:54.67,Default,fb_Announcer,0,0,0,,Game over!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:55.73,0:13:56.93,Default,fb_Guy,0,0,0,,Nice, Masamune!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:56.93,0:13:58.15,Default,fb_Guy,0,0,0,,Nice game!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:58.75,0:14:00.54,Default,fb_Guy,0,0,0,,That's Aoba Junior High's Hongou?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:00.54,0:14:02.09,Default,fb_Guy,0,0,0,,He's a second-year, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:02.09,0:14:04.52,Default,fb_Guy,0,0,0,,He's got a bad attitude, but he's a really good pitcher.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:04.91,0:14:06.41,Default,fb_Guy,0,0,0,,Hongou's crazy!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:06.41,0:14:08.92,Default,fb_Guy,0,0,0,,But doesn't that other guy pitch faster?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:09.74,0:14:10.42,Default,fb_Guy,0,0,0,,Who do you mean?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:10.42,0:14:12.42,Default,fb_Guy,0,0,0,,Furuya Satoru from Tomakomai Junior High.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:12.42,0:14:14.42,Default,fb_Guy,0,0,0,,Oh, right, him!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:15.00,0:14:17.64,Default,fb_Guy,0,0,0,,The catcher couldn't catch his pitches, so the game didn't go well.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:17.64,0:14:19.78,Default,fb_Guy,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone pitch like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:19.78,0:14:21.12,Default,fb_Guy,0,0,0,,No one can compare.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:21.12,0:14:23.08,Default,fb_Guy,0,0,0,,But I haven't heard his name lately.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:23.08,0:14:24.77,Default,fb_Guy,0,0,0,,Is he still playing?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:25.40,0:14:28.06,Default,fb_Enjo,0,0,0,,Is that guy even real?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:28.52,0:14:32.56,Default,fb_Enjo,0,0,0,,Well, if he's as good as they say, we'll face him eventually.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:34.22,0:14:37.90,Default,int_Enjo,0,0,0,,{\i1}We never faced him in junior high.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:39.04,0:14:42.82,Default,int_Enjo,0,0,0,,{\i1}But last fall, at the Jingu Tournament,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:48.67,0:14:51.50,Default,int_Enjo,0,0,0,,{\i1}we saw a closer wearing #1.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:52.56,0:14:53.64,Default,int_Enjo,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was him.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:54.41,0:14:56.86,Default,int_Enjo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Masamune knew the moment he saw him.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:10.94,0:15:16.80,Default,int_Hongo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have you ever seen a white ball flying across the snow?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:17.76,0:15:24.82,Default,int_Hongo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have you ever seen a demon of a man who has sold his soul to baseball?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:28.10,0:15:31.65,Default,fb_Nitta,0,0,0,,That's all of today's snow.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:33.72,0:15:34.95,Default,fb_Nitta,0,0,0,,Now get practicing.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:40.60,0:15:44.87,Default,int_Hongo,0,0,0,,{\i1}We didn't come from Hokkaido to enjoy baseball.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:53.60,0:15:56.10,Default,int_Hongo,0,0,0,,{\i1}We came to take the championship banner.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:58.66,0:16:00.47,Default,int_Hongo,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that's what we'll do!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:00.99,0:16:03.45,Default,_Umpire,0,0,0,,Strike three! You're out!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:06.82,0:16:11.29,Default,int_Hongo,0,0,0,,{\i1}As if you big-city pansies could ever stop us.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:22.08,0:16:23.22,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Snow?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:23.22,0:16:24.42,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Sleet?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:24.42,0:16:26.26,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,I just saw some.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:26.26,0:16:29.01,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,No, that can't be. Not this late in the year.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:29.32,0:16:31.16,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Maybe I imagined it.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:37.87,0:16:39.39,Default,@Maezono,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Kominato!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:39.39,0:16:40.53,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:44.61,0:16:45.78,Default,_Umpire,0,0,0,,Ball!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:45.78,0:16:46.76,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.76,0:16:48.24,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Good eye, good eye!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:48.72,0:16:51.16,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Pick your pitch, Harucchi!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:55.56,0:16:59.74,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Kominato hits to the third baseman, who sends the ball to first.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:59.74,0:17:01.21,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}One out!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:01.21,0:17:01.82,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:01.82,0:17:02.77,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,Nice job, third!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:02.77,0:17:04.18,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,Nice pitch, Masamune!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:04.18,0:17:05.09,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,One out!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:05.38,0:17:06.92,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,It wasn't a bad hit!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:06.92,0:17:07.84,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:09.85,0:17:12.35,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Seidou still doesn't have a hit.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:12.35,0:17:13.71,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,This is nuts.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:18.28,0:17:19.86,Default,Todoroki,0,0,0,,They won't hit!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:19.86,0:17:21.97,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Hongou is on a roll today.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:21.97,0:17:23.40,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,His splitters are too sharp!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:23.40,0:17:26.40,Default,_All,0,0,0,,Pick your pitch!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.83,0:17:29.41,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now it's time for the cleanup hitter Miyuki's third at-bat!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:36.53,0:17:38.04,Default,Ezaki,0,0,0,,A splitter on the first pitch!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:38.04,0:17:40.54,Default,Ezaki,0,0,0,,You can't help but swing at those.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:40.54,0:17:42.06,Default,Ezaki,0,0,0,,Only three innings left.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:42.06,0:17:46.05,Default,Ezaki,0,0,0,,If they don't get a hit soon, \Nthis game really might end up a no-hitter!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:46.58,0:17:49.30,Default,Shirakawa,0,0,0,,That'd be interesting to see.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:51.92,0:17:54.86,Default,int_Shirakawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're there representing Tokyo.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:54.86,0:17:58.78,Default,int_Shirakawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}Start playing like it!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:03.69,0:18:05.32,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Miyuki connects!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:05.32,0:18:07.20,Default,@Maezono,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:07.59,0:18:09.58,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Yes, our first hit!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:09.58,0:18:10.91,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,That's our captain!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:11.20,0:18:12.56,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:12.56,0:18:14.16,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Way to go, Captain!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:15.34,0:18:17.70,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}We won't let it end this way.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:17.70,0:18:22.17,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our ace is pitching just as well as you.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:24.78,0:18:27.84,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Batting fifth, pitcher, Furuya.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:28.62,0:18:30.31,Default,Ezaki,0,0,0,,Will he do a sacrifice bunt?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:30.31,0:18:32.30,Default,Sugi,0,0,0,,Maybe, but they're down by two.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:32.30,0:18:34.15,Default,Sugi,0,0,0,,If it fails, they're screwed.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:35.21,0:18:38.44,Default,Sugi,0,0,0,,It comes down to how well they can use the runner.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:45.15,0:18:47.15,Default,Ezaki,0,0,0,,Another hit!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:49.28,0:18:50.11,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,He caught it!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:52.22,0:18:53.49,Default,_Umpire,0,0,0,,Out!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:54.07,0:18:55.41,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sorry, Masamune!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:55.41,0:18:56.65,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,{\an8}We couldn't get a double play!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:56.65,0:18:58.75,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,{\an8}But that's two outs!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:00.25,0:19:01.50,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Look at me!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:01.50,0:19:03.94,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I'm your elder, and the captain!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:04.75,0:19:06.31,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,Masamune, two outs!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:06.31,0:19:07.12,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,Two outs!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:07.12,0:19:09.46,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}A defense trained on snow-covered ground!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:09.46,0:19:12.26,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}The Komadai Fujimaki fielders have the ace's back!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:12.80,0:19:14.26,Default,Enjo,0,0,0,,Let's finish the inning!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:14.26,0:19:15.76,Default,_All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:17.77,0:19:22.77,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Seidou High School has two outs, but they have a \Nrunner in scoring position for the first time this game.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:22.77,0:19:24.13,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:24.13,0:19:25.54,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Shirasu!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:24.52,0:19:26.49,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now it's up to the six-hole, Shirasu!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:27.32,0:19:29.32,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Can they make use of this opportunity?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:29.32,0:19:30.89,Default,@Maezono,0,0,0,,You can do it, Shirasu!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:30.89,0:19:32.04,Default,@Nakada,0,0,0,,You're on target!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:32.04,0:19:32.82,Default,@Higasa,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:47.48,0:19:48.82,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}It fell off the table!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:48.82,0:19:50.51,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}He goes down swinging!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:52.21,0:19:56.51,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Komadai's Hongou again leaves Seidou scoreless!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:02.74,0:20:04.44,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,We're just getting started!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:04.44,0:20:09.11,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,Hold them off and go again in the next inning!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:11.74,0:20:13.07,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,Masamune!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:13.07,0:20:14.45,Default,_Guy,0,0,0,,Get us another run!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:14.45,0:20:16.27,Default,@Nakada,0,0,0,,Keep it going, Furuya!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:16.27,0:20:17.99,Default,@Seki,0,0,0,,Focus on the first batter!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:18.40,0:20:21.00,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}In the bottom of the seventh, \NKomadai Fujimaki High School is batting.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:21.65,0:20:23.96,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Up at bat is their ace, Hongou Masamune!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:28.38,0:20:30.84,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}He has a sharp swing.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:33.62,0:20:35.68,Default,@int_Miyuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Make sure to keep it low.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:46.45,0:20:48.67,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Swing and a miss on an outside pitch!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:53.75,0:20:55.99,Default,@int_Furuya,0,0,0,,{\i1}No more runs.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:56.82,0:20:57.99,Default,int_Hongo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bring it.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:59.41,0:21:01.24,Default,@int_Furuya,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not a single one.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:02.13,0:21:03.75,Default,@int_Furuya,0,0,0,,{\i1}You won't even reach base!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:03.75,0:21:06.04,Default,int_Hongo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bring it, punk!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:16.47,0:21:18.14,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}And it's caught!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:18.14,0:21:19.97,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Right to the left fielder!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:20.55,0:21:24.48,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}This round of the ace battle goes to Furuya!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:24.48,0:21:26.65,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,Those two are crazy!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:26.65,0:21:27.98,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,They're on fire!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:37.57,0:21:38.98,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Two in a row!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:38.98,0:21:41.12,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's his tenth strikeout!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:41.75,0:21:43.26,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,What kind of game is this?!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:43.26,0:21:44.29,Default,_Fan,0,0,0,,They're too good!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:45.11,0:21:49.79,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}With his form improving,\N he's had perfect fifth, sixth, and seventh innings!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:50.95,0:21:53.55,Default,Nitta,0,0,0,,Looking at this, it's hard to tell who's winning the game.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:54.36,0:21:56.80,Default,Nitta,0,0,0,,That pitcher's good.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:59.33,0:22:01.14,Default,@Kominato,0,0,0,,Nice pitch, Furuya!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:01.82,0:22:03.31,Default,@Kuramochi,0,0,0,,Nice pitching!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:03.31,0:22:06.64,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}There are two innings left in the fourth quarterfinal game.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:07.74,0:22:10.36,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Will Seidou High School be able to catch up?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:14.85,0:22:16.55,Default,_EpTitle,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Blessed by the Baseball Gods."
Dialogue: 5,0:22:18.95,0:22:18.95,Default,chapter,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:49.00,0:23:49.00,Default,chapter,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:49.78,0:23:51.04,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Start with the first batter!
Dialogue: 5,0:23:51.04,0:23:52.87,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Make sure to get him out, Furuya!
Dialogue: 5,0:23:52.87,0:23:55.75,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everyone in the field, help him out!
Dialogue: 5,0:23:55.75,0:23:57.71,Default,@Miyuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's thrown over 120 pitches,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:58.19,0:24:02.93,Default,@Miyuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}but Furuya keeps improving in response to Hongou.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:02.93,0:24:06.03,Default,@Sawamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Only one inning left to score.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:06.03,0:24:08.90,Default,@Kominato,0,0,0,,{\i1}We won't let this end yet.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:08.90,0:24:11.47,Default,@Kominato,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll make sure Miyuki gets a chance to bat.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:12.39,0:24:15.23,Default,@Kominato,0,0,0,,{\i1}Next time on {\i0}Ace of the Diamond act II{\i1}:
Dialogue: 5,0:24:15.23,0:24:16.66,Default,@Kominato,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The Day It Began."
Dialogue: 5,0:24:16.66,0:24:18.94,Default,@Kominato,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's win the national title!
